claim.claim-text:
a display panel (10) to display an image;
a cabinet (200) having a front part covering a front edge portion of the display panel and a side part covering a side portion of the display panel;
a backlight unit (20) disposed on a rear side of the display panel to provide light onto the display panel;
a bottom cover (100) disposed on a rear side of the backlight unit, the bottom cover being coupled to the cabinet to package the display panel and the backlight unit; and
a back cover (500) covering a first portion of a rear side of the bottom cover (100);
wherein the front part of the cabinet (200), the side part of the cabinet (200), and a second portion of the rear side of the bottom cover (100) are exposed outwardly,
wherein the cabinet (200) includes:
- at least one first fitting rib (220) protruding from a back surface (202) of the front part of the cabinet at an upper portion and both lateral portions;
- at least one first latch protrusion (210) protruding from the side part of the cabinet; and
- at least one second fitting rib (220) protruding from the front part of the cabinet (200) at a lower portion,
